{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18487","headline":"福州送郑楚材赴京时监察刘公亮有感激郑意 · 欧阳詹","name":"福州送郑楚材赴京时监察刘公亮有感激郑意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美人河岳灵，家本荥水濆。\n门承若兰族，身蕴如琼文。\n早折青桂枝，俯窥鸿鹄羣。\n迩来丹霄姿，远逐苍梧云。\n有伊光鉴人，惜兹瑶蕙薰。\n中酣前激昂，四座同氛氲。\n海郡梅霪晴，山邮炎景曛。\n回翔罢南游，鸣唳期西闻。\n秦塞鸾凤征，越江云雨分。\n从兹一别离，伫致如尧君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}